tone 1 (uses DecompositionPlan models)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 3: Executive Director Integration\\n**Objective**: Integrate decomposition engine into Executive Director workflow.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. Updated `leadership/executive_director.md` with:\\n   - New decomposition workflow\\n   - Extended output format with `decomposition_plan` field\\n   - User approval flow for plans\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Executive Director uses decomposition before spawning agents\\n- Output includes decomposition plan\\n- Supports plan approval workflow\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1, 2\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 4: API Endpoints\\n**Objective**: Add backend API endpoints for decomposition functionality.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. Updated `src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py` with:\\n   - `POST /api/decompose` - Decompose user request\\n   - `POST /api/approve-plan` - Accept/reject/modify plans\\n   - `GET /api/decomposition-history` - Historical accuracy\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- All endpoints functional\\n- Proper error handling\\n- Integration with decomposition engine\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1, 2\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 5: Frontend Visualization\\n**Objective**: Build React component for task decomposition visualization.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/TaskDecompositionViewer.jsx` with:\\n   - Mermaid diagram rendering\\n   - Resource estimates display\\n   - Execution wave visualization\\n   - Agent assignment table\\n   - Approve/Reject/Modify buttons\\n   - Plan modification interface\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Renders dependency graph with Mermaid\\n- Displays resource estimates\\n- Action buttons work correctly\\n- Responsive UI\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 4 (needs API endpoints)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 6: Test Suite\\n**Objective**: Comprehensive testing for all decomposition functionality.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `tests/test_decomposition.py` with:\\n   - Unit tests for each method\\n   - Integration tests for full flow\\n   - Graph validity tests\\n   - Benchmark tests (simple, medium, complex)\\n   - Learning accuracy tests\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- All unit tests pass\\n- Integration tests cover full workflow\\n- DAG validity verified\\n- Performance benchmarks documented\\n\\n**Dependencies**: Milestones 1, 2, 4\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Milestone 7: Documentation\\n**Objective**: Complete documentation for the decomposition engine.\\n\\n**Deliverables**:\\n1. `TASK_DECOMPOSITION.md` with:\\n   - Architecture overview\\n   - Usage examples\\n   - API reference\\n   - Configuration options\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\\n- Clear architecture explanation\\n- Working code examples\\n- Complete API documentation\\n- Configuration fully documented\\n\\n**Dependencies**: All previous milestones\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Execution Order\\n1. Milestone 1 (Core Engine) - Foundation\\n2. Milestone 2 (Learning Module) - Builds on engine\\n3. Milestones 3, 4 (Integration + API) - Can run in parallel\\n4. Milestone 5 (Frontend) - Needs API\\n5. Milestone 6 (Tests) - Needs all code\\n6. Milestone 7 (Documentation) - Final\\n\\n## Estimated Timeline\\n- Milestones 1-2: Core implementation\\n- Milestones 3-5: Integration and UI\\n- Milestones 6-7: Quality and documentation\\n\\n## Risk Assessment\\n- **Medium Risk**: NetworkX/PuLP integration complexity\\n- **Low Risk**: Standard patterns for API/UI\\n- **Mitigation**: Use existing project patterns, fallback to simpler algorithms if needed\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_015fnZ8YHjENQ5c2qYUzn8kQ', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md', 'content': '# Backend Tasks - Milestone 1: Core Infrastructure & Decomposition Engine\n\n## Task 1: Data Models Setup\n- **Name**: Implement Pydantic Data Models\n- **Description**: Create Pydantic models for task analysis and decomposition\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * All models defined: TaskAnalysis, SubTask, DecompositionPlan, ResourceEstimate\n  * Proper type hints and validation\n  * JSON schema generation works\n- **Complexity**: Simple\n- **Dependencies**: None\n\n## Task 2: Decomposition Engine Core Logic \n- **Name**: Implement TaskDecompositionEngine Base Class\n- **Description**: Create core engine class with key decomposition methods\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * `analyze_task` method functional\n  * Basic complexity scoring\n  * Domain categorization logic\n- **Complexity**: Medium\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1 (Data Models)\n\n## Task 3: DAG Generation with NetworkX\n- **Name**: Implement Dependency Graph Generation\n- **Description**: Use NetworkX to create directed acyclic graphs for task dependencies\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Create valid DAGs\n  * Cycle detection and prevention\n  * Topological sorting of tasks\n- **Complexity**: Complex\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2\n\n## Task 4: Resource Estimation Module\n- **Name**: Build Resource Estimation Logic\n- **Description**: Implement resource cost and allocation estimation\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Calculate computational complexity\n  * Estimate token usage\n  * Basic cost projection\n  * Optimize for parallel execution\n- **Complexity**: Complex\n- **Dependencies**: Task 2, Task 3\n\n## Task 5: Execution Schedule Generator\n- **Name**: Create Execution Wave Planner\n- **Description**: Generate parallel execution schedules\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Create execution waves\n  * Respect task dependencies\n  * Optimize for concurrent processing\n- **Complexity**: Complex\n- **Dependencies**: Task 3, Task 4\n\n## Task 6: Logging and Observability\n- **Name**: Add Comprehensive Logging\n- **Description**: Implement logging for decomposition engine\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Log key events and decision points\n  * Structured logging format\n  * Configurable log levels\n- **Complexity**: Simple\n- **Dependencies**: Task 2\n\n## Task 7: Initial Configuration Management\n- **Name**: Configure Decomposition Parameters\n- **Description**: Set up configurable parameters for the engine\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Default configuration values\n  * Ability to override via environment/config\n  * Validate configuration options\n- **Complexity**: Simple\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2\n\n## Implementation Strategy\n1. Implement tasks in numerical order\n2. Use TDD approach for each component\n3. Ensure high test coverage\n4. Validate against architecture guidelines\n\n## Performance Targets\n- Latency: < 100ms for small tasks\n- Memory usage: < 50MB per decomposition\n- Scalability: Support tasks up to 100 subtasks\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Handling extremely complex task graphs\n- Accurate resource estimation\n- Avoiding over-decomposition\n\n## Recommended Approach\n- Start with simple decomposition logic\n- Incrementally add complexity\n- Use extensive unit and integration testing\n\n## Estimated Development Time\n- Total: 3-5 days\n- Per task: 0.5-1 day'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015fnZ8YHjENQ5c2qYUzn8kQ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1_20260116_025940.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1_20260116_025940.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a Backend Coordinator agent.\n\n## Purpose\nBreaks backend milestones into specific API, database, and service tasks. Analyzes architecture and requirements to identify backend components, endpoints, data models, and business logic. Coordinates backend development through TDD Coordina