 for task analysis and decomposition\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * All models defined: TaskAnalysis, SubTask, DecompositionPlan, ResourceEstimate\n  * Proper type hints and validation\n  * JSON schema generation works\n- **Complexity**: Simple\n- **Dependencies**: None\n\n## Task 2: Decomposition Engine Core Logic \n- **Name**: Implement TaskDecompositionEngine Base Class\n- **Description**: Create core engine class with key decomposition methods\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * `analyze_task` method functional\n  * Basic complexity scoring\n  * Domain categorization logic\n- **Complexity**: Medium\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1 (Data Models)\n\n## Task 3: DAG Generation with NetworkX\n- **Name**: Implement Dependency Graph Generation\n- **Description**: Use NetworkX to create directed acyclic graphs for task dependencies\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Create valid DAGs\n  * Cycle detection and prevention\n  * Topological sorting of tasks\n- **Complexity**: Complex\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2\n\n## Task 4: Resource Estimation Module\n- **Name**: Build Resource Estimation Logic\n- **Description**: Implement resource cost and allocation estimation\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Calculate computational complexity\n  * Estimate token usage\n  * Basic cost projection\n  * Optimize for parallel execution\n- **Complexity**: Complex\n- **Dependencies**: Task 2, Task 3\n\n## Task 5: Execution Schedule Generator\n- **Name**: Create Execution Wave Planner\n- **Description**: Generate parallel execution schedules\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Create execution waves\n  * Respect task dependencies\n  * Optimize for concurrent processing\n- **Complexity**: Complex\n- **Dependencies**: Task 3, Task 4\n\n## Task 6: Logging and Observability\n- **Name**: Add Comprehensive Logging\n- **Description**: Implement logging for decomposition engine\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Log key events and decision points\n  * Structured logging format\n  * Configurable log levels\n- **Complexity**: Simple\n- **Dependencies**: Task 2\n\n## Task 7: Initial Configuration Management\n- **Name**: Configure Decomposition Parameters\n- **Description**: Set up configurable parameters for the engine\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\n  * Default configuration values\n  * Ability to override via environment/config\n  * Validate configuration options\n- **Complexity**: Simple\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2\n\n## Implementation Strategy\n1. Implement tasks in numerical order\n2. Use TDD approach for each component\n3. Ensure high test coverage\n4. Validate against architecture guidelines\n\n## Performance Targets\n- Latency: < 100ms for small tasks\n- Memory usage: < 50MB per decomposition\n- Scalability: Support tasks up to 100 subtasks\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Handling extremely complex task graphs\n- Accurate resource estimation\n- Avoiding over-decomposition\n\n## Recommended Approach\n- Start with simple decomposition logic\n- Incrementally add complexity\n- Use extensive unit and integration testing\n\n## Estimated Development Time\n- Total: 3-5 days\n- Per task: 0.5-1 day'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015fnZ8YHjENQ5c2qYUzn8kQ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1_20260116_025940.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1_20260116_025940.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a Backend Coordinator agent.\n\n## Purpose\nBreaks backend milestones into specific API, database, and service tasks. Analyzes architecture and requirements to identify backend components, endpoints, data models, and business logic. Coordinates backend development through TDD Coordina