{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 03:00:56", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-0b9d669f-d5a3-4048-94e7-1519f28f4521', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "milestone": "Milestone 1: Core Decomposition Engine & Data Models - Implement the core decomposition engine with all data models and basic algorithms including Pydantic models, TaskDecompositionEngine class, task analysis algorithms, DAG generation, resource estimation, and test suite",\n  "architecture": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/completed/decomposition_architecture.md",\n  "requirements": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/completed/decomposition_architecture.md",\n  "output_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m1.md"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Y5dwGTPFZ1hG57D5Gg9KpF', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/completed/decomposition_architecture.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Y5dwGTPFZ1hG57D5Gg9KpF', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Smart Task Decomposition Engine - Architecture Design\\n\\n## Overview\\nThe Smart Task Decomposition Engine transforms complex user requests into optimized, parallel execution plans with resource estimation and continuous learning.\\n\\n## System Architecture\\n\\n```\\n\\u250c\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2510\\n\\u2502                          Frontend (React)                                \\u2502\\n\\u2502  \\u250c\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2510  \\u2502\\n\\u2502  \\u2502                    TaskDecompositionViewer.jsx                     \\u2502  \\u2502\\n\\u2502  \\u2502  - Mermaid dependency graph                                        \\u2502  \\u2502\\n\\u2502  \\u2502  - Resource estimates display                                      \\u2502  \\u2502\\n\\u2502  \\u2502  - Execution wave visualization                                    \\u2502  \\u2502\\n\\u2502  \\u2502  - Approve/Reject/Modify actions                                   \\u2502  \\u2502\\n\\u2502  \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u2500\\u25