{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 03:01:03", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-d1ec75fe-ec68-4f05-89c0-e0de760eea3a', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/ai_provider_enhancement_milestones.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "AI Provider Enhancement System",\n  "project_id": "326e1466",\n  "task_id": "b8702ba4"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FSHNXeLbmwHccLP26xq2aW', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/ai_provider_enhancement_milestones.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01FSHNXeLbmwHccLP26xq2aW', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# AI Provider Enhancement System - Milestone Plan\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n**Project ID**: 3cd35d78\\n**Created**: 2026-01-13\\n**Status**: Planning\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Milestone 1: CLI Provider Integration\\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\\n**Priority**: Highest\\n\\n### Objective\\nImplement CLI provider adapter system that detects and uses locally installed Claude CLI and ChatGPT CLI tools as preferred API alternatives.\\n\\n### Deliverables\\n1. `provider_manager.py` - AI provider abstraction and detection system\\n2. `cli_provider.py` - CLI provider implementations for Claude and ChatGPT\\n3. Updated `runtime.py` - Integration with provider manager\\n4. Unit tests for provider detection and execution\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] Claude CLI at `/opt/homebrew/bin/claude` is detected automatically\\n- [ ] CLI provider executes prompts using `claude --print` flag\\n- [ ] Graceful fallback to Anthropic API when CLI unavailable\\n- [ ] Provider success/failure metrics tracked in database\\n- [ ] No increase in execution latency >10%\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n- Existing runtime.py infrastructure\\n- Claude CLI installed at `/opt/homebrew/bin/claude`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Milestone 2: Cost Estimation Module\\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n### Objective\\nImplement comprehensive pre-execution cost estimation and post-execution cost tracking with dashboard integration.\\n\\n### Deliverables\\n1. `cost_estimator.py` - Pre-execution cost estimation based on task complexity\\n2. Enhanced `cost_calculator.py` - Extended with estimation capabilities\\n3. Updated `metrics.py` - Cost tracking fields and aggregation queries\\n4. Cost API endpoints for dashboard\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] Pre-execution cost estimates available before spawning agents\\n- [ ] Estimates within 50% of actual costs\\n- [ ] Cost aggregation by project, agent type, and time period\\n- [ ] Cost fields added to agent_executions table\\n- [ ] API endpoints expose cost data to dashboard\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n- Milestone 1 (provider tracking needed for CLI vs API cost differentiation)\\n- Existing cost_calculator.py\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Milestone 3: Smart Agent Router\\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\\n**Priority**: Medium-High\\n\\n### Objective\\nImplement intelligent agent-task routing based on historical performance metrics.\\n\\n### Deliverables\\n1. `agent_router.py` - Performance analysis and routing recommendations\\n2. Updated agent execution flow to use router recommendations\\n3. Routing analytics API endpoints\\n4. Dashboard widget for routing explanations\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] Agent recommendations based on historical performance from metrics.db\\n- [ ] Routing considers success rate (50%), cost efficiency (30%), speed (20%)\\n- [ ] Agent specialization bonuses applied (e.g., code_writer +10% for code tasks)\\n- [ ] Override capability for manual agent selection\\n- [ ] 10% improvement in overall success rate (measurable after deployment)\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n- Milestone 2 (cost data needed for cost efficiency calculations)\\n- Populated metrics.db with historical data\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Milestone 4: Project Recovery & Dashboard Integration\\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\\n**Priority**: Medium\\n\\n### Objective\\nRestart 10 stalled projects and integrate all new features into the dashboard.\\n\\n### Deliverables\\n1. `recovery_orchestrator.py` - Project recovery logic\\n2. Recovery execution report\\n3. Dashboard integration for provider, cost, and routing features\\n4. Updated frontend components\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] All 10 stalled projects attempted for restart\\n- [ ] Recovery report generated with outcomes per project\\n- [ ] Independent error boundaries (one failure doesn\'t stop others)\\n- [ ] Dashboard shows provider usage, cost trends, routing info\\n- [ ] Provider success rates visible in dashboard\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n- Milestones 1-3 completed\\n- Access to project tracking system\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Milestone Summary\\n\\n| Milestone | Objective | Duration | Dependencies |\\n|-----------|-----------|----------|--------------|\\n| 1 | CLI Provider Integration | 2-3 days | None |\\n| 2 | Cost Estimation Module | 2-3 days | Milestone 1 |\\n| 3 | Smart Agent Router | 2-3 days | Milestone 2 |\\n| 4 | Project Recovery & Dashboard | 2-3 days | Milestones 1-3 |\\n\\n**Total Estimated Duration**: 8-12 days\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Technical Decisions Made\\n\\n### TD1: Provider Selection Strategy\\n- **Decision**: CLI preferred over API when available\\n- **Rationale**: CLI tools use user\'s existing subscription, avoiding API costs\\n\\n### TD2: Cost Estimation Approach\\n- **Decision**: Use task complexity heuristics for output token estimation\\n- **Rationale**: More accurate than fixed estimates, calibrated to task types\\n\\n### TD3: Routing Algorithm Weights\\n- **Decision**: 50% success rate, 30% cost efficiency, 20% speed\\n- **Rationale**: Reliability most important, then cost, then speed\\n\\n### TD4: Recovery Sequence\\n- **Decision**: Sequential processing, not parallel\\n- **Rationale**: Easier debugging, independent error boundaries, API rate limits\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Files to Create\\n- `src/runtime/agents/provider_manager.py`\\n- `src/runtime/agents/cli_provider.py`\\n- `src/runtime/agents/cost_estimator.py`\\n- `src/runtime/agents/agent_router.py`\\n- `src/runtime/agents/recovery_orchestrator.py`\\n\\n## Files to Modify\\n- `src/runtime/agents/runtime.py`\\n- `src/runtime/agents/metrics.py`\\n- `src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py`\\n- `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/App.jsx`\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Document Status**: Complete\\n**Next Step**: System Architecture\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01YVZDN1HGsd1fmxfcZtUKQ8', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/ai_provider_enhancement_milestones.md', 'project_name': 'AI Provider Enhancement System', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01YVZDN1HGsd1fmxfcZtUKQ8', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01ASgS4BKkcsDDxnm8skHbUN', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01ASgS4BKkcsDDxnm8skHbUN', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# AI Provider Enhancement System - Architecture Proposal\\n\\n## A. Architecture Overview\\n\\n### System Architecture Pattern: Modular Microservices with Event-Driven Design\\n- Decoupled, extensible architecture focusing on provider flexibility\\n- Event-driven communication between components\\n- Microservices approach allows independent scaling and deployment\\n\\n## B. Tech Stack\\n\\n### Backend\\n- **Language**: Python 3.9+ \\n  - Rationale: Strong typing, excellent data processing, AI integration libraries\\n- **Frameworks**: \\n  - FastAPI for API layer (lightweight, async support)\\n  - SQLAlchemy for database interactions\\n  - Pydantic for data validation\\n\\n### Frontend\\n- **Framework**: React 18 \\n  - Rationale: Component-based, performance, rich ecosystem\\n- **State Management**: Redux Toolkit\\n  - For complex global state tracking of providers, costs, routing\\n- **Charting**: Recharts for cost and performance visualizations\\n\\n### Database\\n- **Primary Database**: PostgreSQL\\n  - Rationale: ACID compliance, robust JSON support, advanced querying\\n- **ORM**: SQLAlchemy with Alembic for migrations\\n- **Key Collections**: \\n  - `agent_executions`\\n  - `provider_metrics`\\n  - `project_tracking`\\n\\n### Infrastructure\\n- **Containerization**: Docker\\n- **Orchestration**: docker-compose for local, Kubernetes for production\\n- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions\\n\\n## C. System Components\\n\\n### 1. Provider Management Service\\n- **Responsibility**: Detect and manage AI provider interfaces\\n- **Key Files**: \\n  - `provider_manager.py`\\n  - `cli_provider.py`\\n- **Capabilities**:\\n  - CLI tool detection\\n  - Provider selection strategy\\n  - Fallback mechanisms\\n\\n### 2. Cost Estimation Module\\n- **Responsibility**: Pre and post-execution cost tracking\\n- **Key Files**:\\n  - `cost_estimator.py`\\n  - `cost_calculator.py`\\n- **Features**:\\n  - Complexity-based estimation\\n  - Historical cost analysis\\n  - Per-project cost tracking\\n\\n### 3. Agent Router\\n- **Responsibility**: Intelligent task routing\\n- **Key Files**:\\n  - `agent_router.py`\\n- **Routing Criteria**:\\n  - Success Rate (50%)\\n  - Cost Efficiency (30%)\\n  - Execution Speed (20%)\\n  - Specialization Bonuses\\n\\n### 4. Recovery Orchestrator\\n- **Responsibility**: Project restart and management\\n- **Key Files**:\\n  - `recovery_orchestrator.py`\\n- **Features**:\\n  - Sequential project recovery\\n  - Independent error handling\\n  - Comprehensive reporting\\n\\n## D. File/Directory Structure\\n```\\nensemble/\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 src/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 runtime/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 agents/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 provider_manager.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 cli_provider.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 cost_estimator.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 agent_router.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 recovery_orchestrator.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 field/\\n\\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 ensemble_ui/\\n\\u2502           \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 backend/\\n\\u2502           \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 frontend/\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 tests/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 unit/\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 integration/\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 docs/\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 deployment/\\n    \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 docker/\\n    \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 kubernetes/\\n```\\n\\n## E. Data Model\\n\\n### Agent Execution Tracking\\n```sql\\nTABLE agent_executions (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,\\n    agent_type VARCHAR,\\n    provider VARCHAR,\\n    status VARCHAR,\\n    start_time TIMESTAMP,\\n    end_time TIMESTAMP,\\n    estimated_cost DECIMAL,\\n    actual_cost DECIMAL,\\n    success_rate FLOAT\\n)\\n```\\n\\n## F. API Design\\n\\n### Cost API Endpoints\\n- `GET /api/costs/project/{project_id}`\\n- `GET /api/costs/summary`\\n- `GET /api/providers/metrics`\\n\\n### Authentication\\n- JWT-based authentication\\n- Role-based access control\\n\\n## G. Deployment Strategy\\n\\n### Local Development\\n- Docker Compose\\n- Hot reloading for backend/frontend\\n- Isolated service containers\\n\\n### Production\\n- Kubernetes Deployment\\n- Horizontal Pod Autoscaling\\n- Blue-Green Deployments\\n\\n## H. Testing Strategy\\n\\n### Unit Testing\\n- pytest for backend\\n- Jest for frontend components\\n- 90%+ code coverage target\\n\\n### Integration Testing\\n- End-to-end provider routing scenarios\\n- Cost estimation accuracy validation\\n- Recovery orchestration testing\\n\\n## I. Alternatives Considered\\n\\n### Alternative 1: Monolithic Architecture\\n- **Pros**: Simpler initial setup\\n- **Cons**: Less scalable, harder to maintain\\n- **Decision**: Rejected in favor of microservices\\n\\n### Alternative 2: Direct API Only\\n- **Pros**: Fewer dependencies\\n- **Cons**: Less flexible, higher cost\\n- **Decision**: Rejected; CLI integration preferred\\n\\n## J. Risks and Mitigations\\n\\n1. **Provider Availability Risk**\\n   - Mitigation: Robust fallback mechanisms\\n   - Multi-provider support\\n\\n2. **Cost Estimation Accuracy**\\n   - Mitigation: Machine learning model for estimation\\n   - Continuous calibration\\n\\n3. **Performance Overhead**\\n   - Mitigation: Lightweight implementations\\n   - Caching strategies\\n\\n## K. Open Questions\\n\\n1. Preferred cloud provider for production\\n2. Specific compliance requirements\\n3. Expected scale of deployment\\n\\n## Conclusion\\nThis architecture provides a flexible, scalable solution for AI provider management, with clear separation of concerns and extensible design."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FkqWrdoJd23PonLsWHm3Wb', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Milestone 1: CLI Provider Integration - Implement CLI provider adapter system that detects and uses locally installed Claude CLI and ChatGPT CLI tools as preferred API alternatives.', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/ai_provider_enhancement_milestones.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01FkqWrdoJd23PonLsWHm3Wb', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "tasks_identified": 8, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "dependencies": ["Task 1.1 (Provider Interface) \\u2192 Task 1.2 (Claude CLI)", "Task 1.1 (Provider Interface) \\u2192 Task 2.1 (Metrics Extension)", "Task 1.2 (Claude CLI) \\u2192 Task 1.3 (ChatGPT CLI)", "Task 2.1 (Metrics Extension) \\u2192 Task 2.2 (Performance Tracking)", "Task 1.3 (ChatGPT CLI) + Task 2.2 (Performance Tracking) \\u2192 Task 3.1 (Runtime Integration)", "Task 3.1 (Runtime Integration) \\u2192 Task 3.2 (Configuration)", "Task 3.2 (Configuration) \\u2192 Task 4.1 (Integration Tests)", "Task 4.1 (Integration Tests) \\u2192 Task 4.2 (Documentation)"], "message": "Successfully identified 8 backend tasks organized in 4 phases: Foundation (provider abstraction and CLI implementations), Provider Metrics (tracking and performance), Runtime Integration (system integration and configuration), and Testing/Validation (comprehensive tests and documentation). Critical path focuses on provider interface \\u2192 CLI implementations \\u2192 runtime integration. All tasks include specific acceptance criteria and are ready for TDD Coordinator implementation."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_017EfAw1gskmv3W2ph67brsM', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/test_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Milestone 1: CLI Provider Integration - Implement CLI provider adapter system that detects and uses locally installed Claude CLI and ChatGPT CLI tools as preferred API alternatives.', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/ai_provider_enhancement_milestones.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_017EfAw1gskmv3W2ph67brsM', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "test_tasks_identified": 5, "coverage_goal": 85, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md", "message": "Comprehensive test strategy defined for CLI Provider Integration milestone. Created 5 test tasks covering unit tests (provider manager, CLI provider, runtime integration), integration tests (detection, execution, database), and E2E tests (provider selection, performance). Established 85% coverage goal with focus on provider detection logic, CLI execution workflows, and fallback mechanisms. Performance testing ensures <10% overhead vs baseline API execution."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Sq2iThtKzhk6ptjuMoHQMz', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Sq2iThtKzhk6ptjuMoHQMz', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Backend Tasks - Project View API Development\\n\\n## Task Overview\\nImplement new backend API endpoints and supporting logic for project data retrieval and continuation.\\n\\n## Task Breakdown\\n\\n### 1. Endpoint Implementation: Project Details Endpoint\\n- **Name**: Implement `/api/projects/{project_id}/details` GET endpoint\\n- **Description**: Create FastAPI endpoint to retrieve comprehensive project details\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Endpoint returns full project details schema\\n  - Handles existing project_id \\n  - Returns 404 for unknown project_id\\n  - Retrieves data from project_tracker module\\n- **Dependencies**: \\n  - project_tracker module\\n  - Existing project data model\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n\\n### 2. SDLC Phase Detection Logic\\n- **Name**: Develop SDLC Phase Detection Utility\\n- **Description**: Create logic to automatically detect project SDLC phase \\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Analyzes project notes and tasks\\n  - Identifies phase based on defined keywords\\n  - Handles multiple detection strategies\\n  - Defaults to \\"unknown\\" if no phase detected\\n- **Dependencies**:\\n  - project_tracker module\\n  - Existing project notes/tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n### 3. Endpoint Implementation: Project Continuation \\n- **Name**: Implement `/api/projects/{project_id}/continue` POST endpoint\\n- **Description**: Create endpoint to trigger project continuation process\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Accepts optional instruction parameter\\n  - Spawns Executive Director agent\\n  - Returns request_id and success status\\n  - Handles project not found scenario\\n- **Dependencies**:\\n  - Executive Director agent\\n  - project_tracker module\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n### 4. Input Validation and Error Handling\\n- **Name**: Add Robust Validation for New Endpoints\\n- **Description**: Implement comprehensive input validation and error management\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Validates project_id format (UUID)\\n  - Handles missing/invalid parameters\\n  - Returns consistent error responses\\n  - Implements rate limiting for continue endpoint\\n- **Dependencies**:\\n  - Validation libraries (Pydantic)\\n  - Error handling utilities\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n\\n### 5. Integration Testing\\n- **Name**: Create Backend Integration Tests\\n- **Description**: Develop comprehensive test suite for new endpoints\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Unit tests for SDLC phase detection\\n  - Integration tests for API endpoints\\n  - Mock project_tracker for isolated testing\\n  - 90%+ test coverage\\n- **Dependencies**:\\n  - Existing project data\\n  - pytest framework\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n\\n## Task Dependencies\\n1. Task 2 (SDLC Phase Detection) must be completed before Tasks 1 and 3\\n2. Task 4 (Input Validation) applies to Tasks 1 and 3\\n3. Task 5 (Testing) can run in parallel with implementation tasks\\n\\n## Performance Targets\\n- Endpoint response time: < 500ms\\n- Continuation request processing: < 1s\\n\\n## Security Considerations\\n- No authentication required for these endpoints\\n- Implement rate limiting\\n- Validate and sanitize all inputs\\n\\n## Estimated Effort\\n- Total Estimated Effort: 3-5 development days\\n- Recommended Team: 1-2 backend developers\\n\\n## Delivery Recommendations\\n- Implement in order of dependencies\\n- Continuously integrate and test\\n- Use feature flags for gradual rollout"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_019pvBQaQAoYDxtcT4Riejgw', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_019pvBQaQAoYDxtcT4Riejgw', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Test Strategy - Milestone 1: CLI Provider Integration\\n\\n## Overview\\n**Milestone**: CLI Provider Integration - Implement CLI provider adapter system that detects and uses locally installed Claude CLI and ChatGPT CLI tools as preferred API alternatives.\\n\\n**Testing Philosophy**: Comprehensive test coverage for provider detection, CLI execution, fallback mechanisms, and performance characteristics.\\n\\n## Test Coverage Goals\\n- **Unit Test Coverage**: 85%+ for business logic\\n- **Integration Test Coverage**: 100% of provider workflows  \\n- **E2E Test Coverage**: Critical provider selection and execution paths\\n\\n## Test Categories\\n\\n### 1. Unit Tests\\n\\n#### 1.1 Provider Manager Tests\\n**File**: `tests/unit/test_provider_manager.py`\\n**Target**: `provider_manager.py`\\n**Coverage**: Provider detection, selection logic, configuration\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_detect_claude_cli_present()` - Claude CLI found at expected path\\n- `test_detect_claude_cli_missing()` - Claude CLI not installed\\n- `test_detect_chatgpt_cli_present()` - ChatGPT CLI found and executable\\n- `test_detect_chatgpt_cli_missing()` - ChatGPT CLI not available\\n- `test_provider_selection_preference()` - CLI preferred over API when available\\n- `test_provider_fallback_logic()` - API fallback when CLI fails\\n- `test_provider_config_validation()` - Configuration parameter validation\\n- `test_provider_health_check()` - Provider availability verification\\n\\n#### 1.2 CLI Provider Tests\\n**File**: `tests/unit/test_cli_provider.py`\\n**Target**: `cli_provider.py`\\n**Coverage**: CLI execution, error handling, response parsing\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_claude_cli_execution_success()` - Successful Claude CLI prompt execution\\n- `test_claude_cli_execution_failure()` - CLI execution errors handled gracefully\\n- `test_claude_cli_timeout_handling()` - Long-running CLI commands timeout properly\\n- `test_chatgpt_cli_execution_success()` - ChatGPT CLI execution with correct flags\\n- `test_cli_output_parsing()` - CLI response parsing and formatting\\n- `test_cli_command_construction()` - Proper CLI command building\\n- `test_cli_environment_setup()` - Environment variables and paths configured\\n- `test_cli_security_validation()` - Input sanitization for CLI commands\\n\\n#### 1.3 Runtime Integration Tests\\n**File**: `tests/unit/test_runtime_provider_integration.py`\\n**Target**: Updated `runtime.py`\\n**Coverage**: Provider manager integration with existing runtime\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_runtime_provider_initialization()` - Provider manager setup in runtime\\n- `test_runtime_provider_selection()` - Provider chosen correctly for agent spawn\\n- `test_runtime_fallback_behavior()` - Graceful fallback when provider fails\\n- `test_runtime_metrics_tracking()` - Provider usage metrics recorded\\n- `test_runtime_performance_impact()` - No significant latency increase\\n\\n### 2. Integration Tests\\n\\n#### 2.1 Provider Detection Integration\\n**File**: `tests/integration/test_provider_detection.py`\\n**Coverage**: End-to-end provider detection in real environment\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_full_provider_detection_cycle()` - Complete detection process\\n- `test_provider_detection_with_filesystem()` - Real filesystem path checking\\n- `test_provider_detection_with_permissions()` - Execute permission validation\\n- `test_provider_detection_caching()` - Detection results cached appropriately\\n\\n#### 2.2 CLI Execution Integration\\n**File**: `tests/integration/test_cli_execution.py`\\n**Coverage**: Real CLI execution with mocked external dependencies\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_claude_cli_real_execution()` - Execute actual CLI commands (mocked responses)\\n- `test_cli_execution_with_large_prompts()` - Handle large prompt inputs\\n- `test_cli_execution_concurrent_requests()` - Multiple simultaneous CLI calls\\n- `test_cli_execution_error_scenarios()` - Various CLI failure modes\\n\\n#### 2.3 Database Integration Tests\\n**File**: `tests/integration/test_provider_metrics_db.py`\\n**Coverage**: Provider metrics storage and retrieval\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_provider_success_metrics_stored()` - Success metrics saved to database\\n- `test_provider_failure_metrics_stored()` - Failure metrics recorded properly\\n- `test_provider_performance_metrics()` - Execution time tracking\\n- `test_provider_metrics_aggregation()` - Metrics queried and aggregated correctly\\n\\n### 3. End-to-End Tests\\n\\n#### 3.1 Provider Selection E2E\\n**File**: `tests/e2e/test_provider_selection_flow.py`\\n**Coverage**: Complete user journey with provider selection\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_agent_spawn_with_cli_provider()` - Agent spawned using CLI provider\\n- `test_agent_spawn_with_api_fallback()` - Fallback to API when CLI unavailable\\n- `test_provider_preference_respected()` - CLI used when both CLI and API available\\n\\n#### 3.2 Performance E2E Tests\\n**File**: `tests/e2e/test_provider_performance.py`\\n**Coverage**: Performance characteristics under realistic load\\n\\n**Test Cases**:\\n- `test_cli_provider_latency_acceptable()` - CLI execution within latency limits\\n- `test_provider_switching_performance()` - Fast switching between providers\\n- `test_high_load_provider_stability()` - Stable under concurrent requests\\n\\n## Test Infrastructure\\n\\n### 3.1 Test Fixtures\\n**File**: `tests/fixtures/provider_fixtures.py`\\n\\n**Mock CLI Executables**:\\n- Mock Claude CLI that returns predefined responses\\n- Mock ChatGPT CLI with configurable behavior\\n- Filesystem fixtures with various CLI installation states\\n\\n**Database Fixtures**:\\n- Clean metrics database for each test\\n- Pre-populated provider usage data\\n- Test-specific database configurations\\n\\n### 3.2 Test Utilities\\n**File**: `tests/utils/provider_test_utils.py`\\n\\n**Helper Functions**:\\n- `mock_cli_environment()` - Set up controlled CLI environment\\n- `assert_provider_metrics()` - Validate metrics recording\\n- `create_test_agent_spawn()` - Generate test agent spawn requests\\n- `measure_provider_performance()` - Performance measurement utilities\\n\\n## Test Data Requirements\\n\\n### 3.1 Mock CLI Responses\\n```python\\nCLAUDE_CLI_SUCCESS_RESPONSE = \\"\\"\\"