ptance Criteria**:\n  - CORS configured for local development\n  - Meaningful error messages\n  - Graceful error handling in frontend\n- **Estimated Complexity**: Simple\n- **Dependencies**:\n  - Task 1 and Task 2\n\n## Task Dependencies\n1. Backend Health Check ➔ Debug Activity Tracker Endpoint\n2. Debug Activity Tracker Endpoint ➔ Frontend API Integration\n3. Backend Health Check ➔ CORS Configuration\n\n## Success Criteria\n- No 404 errors when polling files endpoint\n- Correct file data returned in JSON format\n- Reliable polling mechanism\n- Clear error handling and logging'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01L6JaWUXTD95EeYKhMnF9jC', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1_20260116_030105.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1_20260116_030105.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a Backend Coordinator agent.\n\n## Purpose\nBreaks backend milestones into specific API, database, and service tasks. Analyzes architecture and requirements to identify backend components, endpoints, data models, and business logic. Coordinates backend development through TDD Coordinator.\n\n## Instructions\nYou break backend work into actionable tasks for TDD Coordinator to implement via TDD.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. **NEVER write code yourself** - you lack can_write_code permission\n2. **NEVER write tests yourself** - you lack can_write_tests permission\n3. **Only create task breakdowns** - delegate implementation to TDD Coordinator\n\n### Process:\n\n**BE DECISIVE**: Make reasonable technical assumptions. ONLY ask for clarification if requirements are genuinely ambiguous or contradictory.\n\nSee 