untime.py, metrics.py, etc.)\\n- SQLite database (~/.ensemble/metrics.db)\\n\\n## Risks and Mitigations\\n| Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |\\n|------|--------|-------------|------------|\\n| CLI output format changes | High | Low | Parse flexibly, validate structure |\\n| CLI rate limiting | Medium | Medium | Implement backoff, fall back to API |\\n| Cost estimates significantly off | Medium | Medium | Calibrate with actual data |\\n| Recovery spawns fail | Medium | Medium | Independent boundaries, continue on error |\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Document Status**: Complete\\n**Created**: 2026-01-13\\n**Author**: Executive Director\\n**Version**: 1.0\\n**Project ID**: fcf1193e\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01KqxcGKkLyDncrzh4HBsNto', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# AI Provider Enhancement Implementation Milestones\n\n## Milestone 1: CLI Provider Integration & Cost Estimation Foundation\n### Objectives\n- Implement AIProviderManager for detecting and managing CLI providers\n- Create cost estimation module with pre-execution estimation\n- Basic metrics integration for provider tracking\n\n### Deliverables\n- `provider_manager.py`\n- `cli_provider.py`\n- `cost_estimator.py`\n- Updated metrics tracking schema\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- Claude CLI can be detected and used as an execution provider\n- Pre-execution cost estimates generated for tasks\n- Provider success/failure metrics tracked\n\n## Milestone 2: Smart Agent Routing & Dashboard Integration\n### Objectives\n- Implement intelligent agent routing algorithm\n- Create dashboard widgets for cost and provider metrics\n- Enhance project tracking with routing recommendations\n\n### Deliverables\n- `agent_router.py`\n- Dashboard cost/routing widgets\n- Updated project tracking APIs\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- Agent recommendations based on