{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 03:01:24", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-1eb2fbd6-df64-4554-857c-12612173a011', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "problem_description": "Implement Milestone 1: Core Failure Infrastructure for the Failed Task Cleanup System. This includes: 1) CleanupResult and BatchCleanupResult data models in models.py, 2) Configuration module with retention policies and storage paths in config.py, 3) FailureCapture class with reliable file creation, formatting, and fallback mechanisms in failure_capture.py, 4) FailureLinker class to link failures to task records in failure_linker.py. The system must capture failures reliably without AI dependencies - failure capture must never fail. Files should be created in /output/failures/ directory with fallback to /tmp/failures/. File naming: failure_<task_id>_<timestamp>.txt. See architecture at /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture_failed_task_cleanup.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/runtime/agents/failed_task_cleanup",\n  "test_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/tests/runtime/agents/failed_task_cleanup",\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture_failed_task_cleanup.md"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01J2vrCfVEx9ofjnMTX8AXuY', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Failed Task Cleanup System - Milestone 1', 'description': 'Implement